usty shotgun, <strong>The Captain's Ol' Reliable</strong>, and sailed with it across the seven-and-a-half seas in his vessel, the <strong>S.S. Salty</strong>. <br><br>When an unexpected run-in with a group of evil mercenaries leaves him marooned on <strong>Orca Isle</strong> with his ship stolen, Wayne starts doing what he does best: <strong>annihilating everyone responsible.</strong><br><br><i>Equipped with a double barreled shotgun for an arm,</i> countless explosives, and a bad attitude, you’ll have to go toe-to-toe with <strong>The Killer Whales</strong>, the most ruthless mercenaries in all the seven-and-a-half seas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>DO YOU HAVE WHAT IT TAKES TO EMBODY THE CAPTAIN? </strong> Let’s find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/398b3bc986207ef060e5b5d2385966ff.avif?t=1781199423\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras_big/398b3bc986207ef060e5b5d2385966ff.avif?t=1781199423 width=800 height=143 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.poster.avif?t=1781199423\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.webm?t=1781199423\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2319790/extras/ebe46df394016c6d88319b079e143d6d.mp4?t=1781199423\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mow down enemies with your <strong>double-barreled arm</strong>, rip enemies apart with devious <strong>chain-gun fingers</strong>, toss a bottle of the <strong>explosive 